{"title":"BlackHeart Updates the Road Ti with 3D-Printed Details from the Road Plus Ti","link":"https://bikerumor.com/blackheart-updates-the-road-ti-with-3d-printed-details-from-the-road-plus-ti/","date":1792684800000,"content":"<p><img src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-hero.jpeg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" alt=\"(Photos / BlackHeart Bike Co.)\" /></p>\n<p>Truckee, California’s <a href=\"https://blackheartbikeco.com/\" target=\"_blank\">BlackHeart Bike Co</a>. just rolled out an updated Road Ti. This time, the titanium frame reflects a subtle carbon aesthetic with new 3D-printed highlights. But the 3/2.5 double-butted titanium, dropped and slightly curved seatstays, and pro-fit geometry mean that the titanium ride character stays. That formula helped the previous version grab Cyclingworld Europe’s 2024 Best Race Bike award. So yeah, leaving that part alone is a defensible call.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-first-pic.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-first-pic.jpeg\" alt=\"BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-first-pic\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-first-pic.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-first-pic-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-first-pic-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-first-pic-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-first-pic-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-first-pic-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a><figcaption>(Photos / BlackHeart Bike Co.)</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The Road Ti’s new 3D-printed details, which originally debuted on the Road Plus Ti <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/blackheart-launches-road-plus-a-fast-versatile-metal-road-platform-in-ti-and-aluminum/\" target=\"_blank\">earlier this year</a>, trickle down to the new Road Ti. You get a seamless seat tube cutout for extra tire clearance and fender room. The main difference between the two? The Road Ti fits up to 35mm tires with fenders. The Road Plus Ti fits up to 42mm. There are other differences, but start there. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-left.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-left.jpeg\" alt=\"BlackHeart Bike Co New Road Ti left\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-left.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-left-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-left-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-left-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-left-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-left-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-right.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-right.jpeg\" alt=\"BlackHeart Bike Co New Road Ti right\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-right.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-right-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-right-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-right-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-right-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-right-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Also, a T47-68 bottom bracket shell with a lower channel and retaining clip for tidier brake hose routing, and a solid brake mount with a self-guiding hose port. Some of these features could lead to fewer colorful words in the garage when you’re building or servicing this beaut.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ENVE-edition-white.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ENVE-edition-white.jpeg\" alt=\"BlackHeart Bike Co New Road Ti ENVE edition white\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ENVE-edition-white.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ENVE-edition-white-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ENVE-edition-white-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ENVE-edition-white-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ENVE-edition-white-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ENVE-edition-white-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a><figcaption>ENVE Edition</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2>Race Bike Checklist</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The rest reads like a modern race-bike checklist: kammtail downtube, one-piece carbon cockpit, and fully integrated cabling. BlackHeart says it gives little away to the fastest bikes on the road, regardless of material. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-seat-stay-cluster.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-seat-stay-cluster.jpeg\" alt=\"BlackHeart Bike Co New Road Ti seat stay cluster\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-seat-stay-cluster.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-seat-stay-cluster-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-seat-stay-cluster-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-seat-stay-cluster-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-seat-stay-cluster-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-seat-stay-cluster-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-logo.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-logo.jpeg\" alt=\"BlackHeart Bike Co New Road Ti logo\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-logo.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-logo-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-logo-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-logo-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-logo-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-logo-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Frames are reamed, chased, and faced at the factory, so your mechanic doesn’t have to do it. The lifetime warranty against manufacturing defects covers the original owner. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-rear-end.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-rear-end.jpeg\" alt=\"BlackHeart Bike Co New Road Ti rear end\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-rear-end.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-rear-end-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-rear-end-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-rear-end-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-rear-end-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-rear-end-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2>BlackHeart Road Ti Geo</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-geo-e1792602643649.jpeg\"><img width=\"836\" height=\"482\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-geo-e1792602643649.jpeg\" alt=\"BlackHeart Bike Co New Road Ti geo\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-geo-e1792602643649.jpeg 836w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-geo-e1792602643649-297x171.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-geo-e1792602643649-120x69.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-geo-e1792602643649-768x443.jpeg 768w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Signature launch editions with ENVE, SRAM, and Zipp are also available (see below). Then there’s the Perfect Fit Program: a free 30-minute 1:1 consult on size, spec, and geometry. If you complete it and still end up unhappy with your size, BlackHeart covers shipping for a swap. That’s kind of unheard of.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-bottom-bracket.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-bottom-bracket.jpeg\" alt=\"BlackHeart Bike Co New Road Ti bottom bracket\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-bottom-bracket.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-bottom-bracket-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-bottom-bracket-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-bottom-bracket-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-bottom-bracket-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-bottom-bracket-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2>Road Ti Retail &amp; Detail</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Retail: $3,499 (frameset)</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Includes frame, ENVE fork, seatpost, headset</li>\n\n\n\n<li>+$300 for custom fork paint – we can match any automotive paint available</li>\n\n\n\n<li> Available in 9 sizes to fit riders from 5’0″ to 6’7’</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tire clearance up to 700x35mm (with fenders)</li>\n\n\n\n<li>100% recyclable premium 3/2.5 double-butted titanium tubing</li>\n\n\n\n<li>3D-printed details carried over from the Road Plus Ti for real-world usability</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Removable direct mount front derailleur hanger</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cane Creek HCR headset, T47-68 bottom bracket, Round 31.6mm seatpost,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>UDH</li>\n\n\n\n<li>2x/1x electronic</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>BlackHeart Road Ti Signature Builds</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Retail: $5,799 (starting)</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Includes BlackHeart Carbon barstem, SRAM Rival AXS or Shimano 105 Di2 groupset, and Hunt Allroad Alloy wheels</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ENVE-edition-dark.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ENVE-edition-dark.jpeg\" alt=\"BlackHeart Bike Co New Road Ti ENVE edition dark\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ENVE-edition-dark.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ENVE-edition-dark-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ENVE-edition-dark-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ENVE-edition-dark-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ENVE-edition-dark-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ENVE-edition-dark-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>BlackHeart Road Ti ENVE Edition</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Retail: $13,749</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>SRAM Red AXS 2X Power groupset, ENVE SES Aero Pro barstem V2, ENVE SES 4.5 Pro Carbon wheelset, ENVE Carbon seatpost</li>\n\n\n\n<li>CeramicSpeed Alpha BB</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Size 56 = 17 lbs 0 oz</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ZIPP-edition-dark.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ZIPP-edition-dark.jpeg\" alt=\"BlackHeart Bike Co New Road Ti ZIPP edition dark\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ZIPP-edition-dark.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ZIPP-edition-dark-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ZIPP-edition-dark-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ZIPP-edition-dark-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ZIPP-edition-dark-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/BlackHeart-Bike-Co-New-Road-Ti-ZIPP-edition-dark-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>BlackHeart Road Ti Zipp Edition</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Retail: $13,499</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>SRAM Red AXS 2X Power groupset, Zipp SL 80 Race Carbon Handlebar with Zipp SL Service Course Alloy stem, Zipp 202 NSW wheelset, BlackHeart Carbon seatpost</li>\n\n\n\n<li>CeramicSpeed Alpha BB</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Size 56 = 16 lbs 12 oz</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>The new Road Ti will be in stock in November at the link below, as well as through BlackHeart’s growing dealer network.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><em><a href=\"https://blackheartbikeco.com/\" target=\"_blank\">BlackHeartBikeCo.com</a></em></p>","author":"Ron Frazelle","comments":"https://bikerumor.com/blackheart-updates-the-road-ti-with-3d-printed-details-from-the-road-plus-ti/#comments","siteTitle":"Bikerumor","siteHash":"49f427af0a926f4232eb837006841d7242e153e3afbb590f32e4b104ea3e2718","entryHash":"b0e18b47391be86771db2eb2c4b3f2a290871b256e66b93245dae5618a774260","category":"Cycling"}